  m_text: "<size=24>\n- Fruit Reward symbols have two types of prizes\n  : Coin Values
    or Free Games.\n\n    - Each Fruit Reward symbol with\n      \u201CFree Games\u201D
    awards 5 free spins. \n\n- Once total win is evaluated, awarded\n  Fruit Reward
    symbols disappear, and new\n  Fruit Reward symbols cascade down to fill the\n
    empty spots.\n"
