      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<size=24>\n- There is a 5x5 Fruit Reel set above Base Reels\n  where only
    Fruit Reward symbols appear.\n\n- During Base Games, symbols on Fruit Reels come\n 
    down by 1 row every 5 spins.\n\n- During Free Games, symbols on the Fruit Reels\n 
    come down by 1 row on every spin."
